## 6. Scenario Analysis

### 6.1 Stress tests

Metrics based on assumed volatilities say little about what happens in a real crisis, when correlations jump and assets that normally offset each other fall together. So I applied each portfolio to three past episodes and one hypothetical scenario. The table shows what each asset class did in each scenario, and the resulting loss for the portfolio.

